{
    "buildCommand": "bash scripts/build.sh",
    "trailingSlash": false,
    "headers": [
        {
            "_comment": [
                "STATIC ART IS CACHED. There was no Cache-Control anywhere in this repo — not here, not in",
                "next.config.mjs — so public/ was served with Next's default max-age=0 and the browser",
                "revalidated EVERY sprite on EVERY page view. There are 1,150 of them, and a member moving",
                "between the arena, the farm and the casino re-asked for most of them each time.",
                "",
                "Each of those revalidations is a billed edge request. This is the single biggest reducible",
                "number on the invoice and it costs nothing to fix.",
                "",
                "A DAY, not a year, and deliberately not `immutable`: sprite filenames are stable and do get",
                "REDRAWN under the same name — two of the six new fish were rerolled that way an hour ago.",
                "`immutable` would have pinned the unreadable versions in every member's browser for a year.",
                "A day of hard cache plus a week of stale-while-revalidate takes the repeat traffic away while",
                "a redrawn sprite still reaches everybody within a day."
            ],
            "source": "/(images|logo)/(.*)",
            "headers": [
                {
                    "key": "Cache-Control",
                    "value": "public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "source": "/(.*)",
            "headers": [
                {
                    "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
                    "value": "nosniff"
                },
                {
                    "key": "X-Frame-Options",
                    "value": "DENY"
                },
                {
                    "key": "X-XSS-Protection",
                    "value": "1; mode=block"
                },
                {
                    "key": "Referrer-Policy",
                    "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "rewrites": [
        {
            "source": "/sitemap.xml",
            "destination": "/sitemap"
        },
        {
            "source": "/robots.txt",
            "destination": "/robots"
        }
    ],
    "crons": [
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/sail-encounters",
            "schedule": "*/5 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/town-hours",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/consignment-nightly-reports",
            "schedule": "30 7 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/tcg-catalog-sync",
            "schedule": "0 6 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/marketplace-reprice",
            "schedule": "45 6 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/looking-for-alerts",
            "schedule": "0 8 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/product-alerts",
            "schedule": "0 9 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/avatar-sprites",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/leaderboard-badges",
            "schedule": "0 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/boss-auto-tick",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/boss-art",
            "schedule": "0 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/sailing-arrivals",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/inventory-feed",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/marketplace-missions",
            "schedule": "0 14 * * 1"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/marketplace-price-snapshot",
            "schedule": "0 7 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/marketplace-square-sync",
            "schedule": "0 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/daily-strike-nudge",
            "schedule": "0 22 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/crops-ready",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/recap-digest",
            "schedule": "0 17 * * 3"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/timeclock-reminders",
            "schedule": "0,30 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/reminders",
            "schedule": "5 * * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/cash-refunds",
            "schedule": "20 */4 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/prune-app-releases",
            "schedule": "20 8 * * *"
        },
        {
            "path": "/api/jobs/cost-sync",
            "schedule": "40 * * * *"
        }
    ]
}
